<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Breggia Gorge Park geological walk — Castel San Pietro to Mulino del Ghitello</name><desc>Descend from Castel San Pietro through the Breggia gorge via Chiesa Rossa, Punt da Canaa, Canaa Mill, the Witches Meadow and Farügin bridge, then continue past Saceba to Mulino del Ghitello. Follow current park signs and access notices.

